  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Arupanand Mallick vs State Of Ap on 17 July, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.2581 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "A case under Sections 188 and 273 of IPC and Sections 59 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act was registered against the petitioners and they are facing prosecution for the aforesaid offences in the above crime.",
    "arguments": "4. When the matter is take-up for hearing, both the learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor for the respondent-State would submit that the matter is squarely covered by the earlier orders of this Court, wherein this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings initiated based on the similar facts of this case.",
